-- ============================================================================
-- EC7 ASSOCIATE DEEP SEED: Petroleum Industry Act 2021 & Nigerian Fiscal
-- Terms, beginner tier.
--
-- Six modules, 26 lessons, 132 questions (15 per module bank plus a 42
-- question final exam). The structure row is GENERATED from the tier's
-- manifest.json rather than hand typed, and the question rows from the
-- committed bank JSONs under tools/course-banks/pia/beginner.
--
-- What this tier owns: THE MAP OF THE ACT. The institutions and who assesses
-- and collects what; the texts with their editions and read dates; licences,
-- leases and terrains; royalty by terrain and daily rate, gas royalty and gas
-- used in-country; royalty by price on either base year; and the instruments
-- stacked on one ledger with the government take.
--
-- AN ENGINE COURSE. There is no Suite app: the practicals run in the course's
-- own royalty calculator. The Associate capstone grades six Associate
-- quantities, each identical under every open reading of the texts.
-- ============================================================================

values ('pia', 'beginner', '{"modules":[{"key":"m01-who-decides-what","title":"Who Decides What","lesson_keys":["l01-the-act-as-a-system","l02-the-commission-the-authority-and-the-service","l03-who-assesses-and-collects-what","l04-where-the-money-lands","l05-sources-editions-and-the-panels"]},{"key":"m02-licences-leases-and-terrains","title":"Licences, Leases and Terrains","lesson_keys":["l01-exploration-prospecting-and-mining","l02-four-terrains","l03-the-water-depth-line","l04-converted-and-new-leases","l05-the-ekene-cases"]},{"key":"m03-royalty-by-terrain","title":"Royalty by Terrain","lesson_keys":["l01-terrain-rates-and-the-small-field-tranches","l02-condensate-gas-and-liquids","l03-gas-royalty-and-in-country-use","l04-the-daily-rate-the-tranches-read"]},{"key":"m04-royalty-by-price","title":"Royalty by Price","lesson_keys":["l01-the-shape-of-the-royalty-by-price","l02-benchmarks-that-escalate","l03-two-readings-of-the-base-year","l04-frontier-acreage-and-who-receives-it"]},{"key":"m05-the-instruments-stacked","title":"The Instruments Stacked","lesson_keys":["l01-royalty-tax-levy-and-funds-in-order","l02-which-base-each-instrument-reads","l03-host-communities-and-the-nddc-levy","l04-income-tax-and-the-development-levy","l05-government-cash-flow-and-take"]},{"key":"m06-the-associate-reading","title":"The Associate Reading","lesson_keys":["l01-the-map-so-far","l02-reading-one-ledger-end-to-end","l03-the-capstone-brief"]}]}'::jsonb, 1)
